  "details": "VRCSDK Avatars 3.1.12 added Network ID Utility for PhysBones. However the utility just shows up a message, \"Please load a scene with a Scene Descriptor.\"\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\n1. Create a new avatar project with VRCSDK Avatars 3.1.13.\n\n2. Place a valid avatar with PhysBones into the scene.\n\n3. Select a menu item, \"VRChat SDK/Utilities/Network ID Import and Export Utility\" from the menu bar.\n\n4. The utility just shows up a message, \"Please load a scene with a Scene Descriptor.\"\n\nNotes:\n\n- The menu exists since 3.1.10.\n\n- Discord announcement has a mention about the utility, but full changelog doesn't have any mentions. Which is correct?\n\n----\n\n- Discord: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/336764577301659649/1091495992119009410\n\n- Changelog: https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/guides/version-matching/#3112",
